### =====================================================================
### RESGATES — POST /resgates, GET /resgates, GET /resgates/:id
### Débita pontos do cliente_empresa (seed tem 500 pontos). Este arquivo
### cria sua própria recompensa para não depender de rodar 07 antes.
### =====================================================================

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "{{cnpj}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "senha": "{{senha}}"
}
###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Criar recompensa de apoio para o teste de resgate (201)
# @name criarRecompensa
POST {{baseUrl}}/recompensas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Brinde para teste de resgate",
  "custoPontos": 30
}

@recompensaId = {{criarRecompensa.response.body.$.id}}

### Registrar resgate (201) — chave de idempotência via header
# @name registrarResgate
POST {{baseUrl}}/resgates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: resgate-teste-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "{{clienteId}}",
  "recompensaId": "{{recompensaId}}"
}

@resgateId = {{registrarResgate.response.body.$.id}}

### Reenviar com a MESMA Idempotency-Key — deve retornar o resgate já
### criado, sem debitar pontos duas vezes
POST {{baseUrl}}/resgates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: resgate-teste-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "{{clienteId}}",
  "recompensaId": "{{recompensaId}}"
}

### Registrar resgate — saldo insuficiente (custoPontos absurdamente alto)
# @name criarRecompensaCara
POST {{baseUrl}}/recompensas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Recompensa cara demais",
  "custoPontos": 999999
}

@recompensaCaraId = {{criarRecompensaCara.response.body.$.id}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/resgates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "{{clienteId}}",
  "recompensaId": "{{recompensaCaraId}}"
}

### Registrar resgate — payload inválido (422, ids não são uuid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/resgates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "nao-e-uuid",
  "recompensaId": "nao-e-uuid"
}

### Registrar resgate — sem token (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/resgates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "{{clienteId}}",
  "recompensaId": "{{recompensaId}}"
}

### Listar resgates da empresa, paginado (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/resgates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar resgate por id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/resgates/{{resgateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar resgate — id inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/resgates/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
